pendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D13/1/code.py:101:    \"\"\"Inclusive span of the opening on the axis perpendicular to the tail direction.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D13/1/code.py:373:    \"\"\"Cells on the mouth side of bbox, restricted to the cup's perpendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/22/code.py:77:    perpendicular, so there is at most one horizontal and one vertical split.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D13/2/code.py:17:#       expands symmetrically on the perpendicular axis. The discrete layer widths are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D13/2/code.py:109:    perpendicular axis. Each layer is clipped to grid bounds.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D13/2/code.py:353:    \"\"\"Cells on the mouth side of `bbox`, restricted to its perpendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D18/2/code.py:365:    restricted to the cup's perpendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D6/2/code.py:333:    \"\"\"Cells on the mouth side of a cup bbox, limited to the perpendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/0/code.py:381:    \"\"\"Cells on the mouth side of the cup bbox, within the perpendicular extent.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/1/code.py:21:#       perpendicular to the cup axis. Which of the two perpendicular branches is used is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/1/code.py:27:#       use the content centroid projected onto the axis-perpendicular coordinate, compared\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/1/code.py:55:#       - ejection direction equals tail_dir: no longer true; replaced with a perpendicular\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/1/code.py:60:#       - content centroid must not land exactly on the mouth centroid along the perpendicular\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/3dc255db/D14/1/code.py: